Z||000000||fiero56||05-28-2001||10:13 PM||||Figured I would post here so if you came up with a solution you could post here for others.<P>Did you ever solve your overheating problems? I haven't heard anything about them in a while. Have you pulled the head and checked it out yet?<P>My Formula always ran very hot(always over 220 unless I turned on the fan), and the new radiator I installed a few months ago seems to have solved the problem. I haven't even hit the big mark on the temp below 220 in weeks. I even installed a new 195 'stat the other day thinking mine was stuck open.<P>I know you had your radiator checked out, and it wasn't the problem. Just posting what my solution was, and wondering if you have found anything else on yours.||||reg||5
